From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 22:08:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] ci: recover flaky intake overlap and stale cache
 liveness

Reconcile unrelated overlap refusals after key-absence readback even after an ambiguous create. Preserve attempted pages when match readback fails. Deduplicate journal-mode legacy body receipts and re-resolve missing local cached owners only after authoritative listing absence; document foreign-owner recovery.

Proof: three targeted regressions failed on the base; 199 focused tests across 10 files pass with file retries disabled, including real Board/CLI coverage. Seven condition mutants killed. scripts/check: 20 checks pass. No cadence, thresholds, self-heal or autoscaling changes; no savings claim.
